tegy here. You have a massive cumulative lead of 18,400 chips with only 7 hands remaining. The only way to lose the game is to engage in large pots and lose a substantial portion of your stack. Folding 9-7 offsuit, a weak/marginal hand, minimizes variance and protects your lead, virtually guaranteeing the overall game victory.\n\nAnswer: -1'}
